From 55e8ab92cf2cd467ce3d5f1f54b890d69085e707 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: shota <monyuonyu@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 13:41:56 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 098/158] Unified: keep its wording in its own translation file

The integrated environment had changed 1457 translations directly in 13
upstream *_ja.ts files (Part, PartDesign, Sketcher, TechDraw, FreeCAD, ...),
which would conflict with, or be lost in, every upstream translation
update. Move them to Unified's UnifiedWording_ja.ts, registered as an
override translation (it wins whenever the other files are loaded), and
restore the upstream files. Checked: the 646 command texts are unchanged
and each moved entry translates as before.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
